# Lost Chick, BastokMines's owners one by one (the coverage of every owner's trigger and update). A level 30 Warrior,
# ENABLE_CHOCOBO_RAISING on. Each owner in turn is the chick's owner (3 clues, location 2: the var is owner + 0x30 +
# 128) and is asked: the owners with an ask option play their own default event, the ask, then the guess (right:
# updateEvent(1, 1, 1), the Story of a Diligent Chocobo); the owners without one play their question event on trigger
# (priorityEvent, 1) and the guess is the update. Then the same with the next owner as the chick's owner (wrong:
# updateEvent(0, 0, 0), WRONG_OWNER). The trace shows the default event of each ask owner.
lists BastokMines/onEventUpdate/21 BastokMines/Deegis/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventUpdate/537 BastokMines/onEventUpdate/19 BastokMines/onEventUpdate/22 BastokMines/onEventUpdate/23 BastokMines/Griselda/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventUpdate/538 BastokMines/Galdeo/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventUpdate/539
char zone=BastokMines pos=50,0,-109 job=WAR lvl=30
login
charvar [ChocoboRaising]LostChick 177   # owner 1, right at Drangord
trigger Drangord
update 21 option=1
update 21 option=2
finish
charvar [ChocoboRaising]LostChick 178   # owner 2, right at Deegis
trigger Deegis
update 537 option=1
finish
